      "en": "How long, LORD? Will you forget me forever? How long will you hide your face from me?",
      "ko": "여호와여 어느 때까지니이까 나를 영영히 잊으시나이까 주의 얼굴을 나에게서 언제까지 숨기시겠나이까",
      "source_text_hash": "d687498d68ce6215af0c4dec075e54a2670b3c8324394f96eac548a1faefc390",
      "translation_text_hash": "cd886a6585c57003db231191e288f4506f8217c4c5ea2cb0cbdc2fe70297d633",
